        ('/**\n     * Rename current object key to <code>newName</code>\n     * in async mode\n     *\n     * @param newName - new name of object\n     * @return void\n     */', '/**\n     * 将当前对象键重命名为 {@code newName}\n     * in async mode\n     *\n     * @param newName 新键名\n     * @return 无返回值\n     */'),
