        ('/**\n     * Adds object event listener\n     * \n     * @see org.redisson.api.ExpiredObjectListener\n     * @see org.redisson.api.DeletedObjectListener\n     * \n     * @param listener - object event listener\n     * @return listener id\n     */', '/**\n     * 注册对象事件监听器\n     * \n     * @see org.redisson.api.ExpiredObjectListener\n     * @see org.redisson.api.DeletedObjectListener\n     * \n     * @param listener 事件监听器\n     * @return 监听器 ID\n     */'),
