        ('/**\n     * Delete the objects.\n     * Actual removal will happen later asynchronously.\n     * <p>\n     * Requires Redis 4.0+\n     * \n     * @return <code>true</code> if it was exist and deleted else <code>false</code>\n     */', '/**\n     * 异步删除对象；实际内存回收稍后执行。\n     * <p>\n     * 需要 Redis 4.0+\n     * \n     * @return 存在且已删除则为 true，否则 false\n     */'),
